      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第三章 等差数列和等比数列"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "§5. 数列"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "11. 数列的概念"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们按照递增的顺序写出以数字5结尾的两位数："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$15,25,35,45,55,65,75,85,95$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第1个数是15，第2个数是25，第3个数是35，第9个（最后",
        "一个）数是95。从1到9的每一个自然数都和唯一的一个以",
        "数字5结尾的两位数相对应："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$1\\to15$，$2\\to25$，$3\\to35$，…，$9\\to95$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样就给出了一个函数，函数的定义域是集合$\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,9\\}$，",
        "而函数的值域是集合$\\{15,25,35,\\ldots,95\\}$。我们用字母$g$表示",
        "这个函数。于是$g(1)=15$，$g(2)=25$，$g(3)=35$，…，$g(9)=↵95$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看另一个例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们按照递减的顺序排列分子等于1的真分数："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\frac{1}{3}$，$\\frac{1}{4}$，$\\frac{1}{5}$，$\\frac{1}{6}$，…。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上面我们只写出了前5个这种分数。显然，$\\frac{1}{7}$应当在第6",
        "个位置，$\\frac{1}{8}$应当在第7个位置，$\\frac{1}{31}$应当在第30个位置，$\\frac{1}{101}$应"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "67"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
